window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Scared Witchless: Discovering that she's a witch is bad enough, but when Dylan Apel realizes there are folks who'll kill to possess her witchy powers—that's enough to make a girl want to hide out in the back of her boutique. She's barely getting a handle on her new powers when she finds herself surrounded by witches bossing her this way and that, local police nosing about, and wary clients. Can Dylan survive the chaos long enough to figure out her new life?</p> <p>Kiss My Witch: Every time Dylan casts a spell, disaster strikes. When witches flood her peaceful hometown for a convention, Dylan is in no shape to protect herself. She's not sure which will happen first—another witch killing her for her powers, or the ruling council punishing her for misuse of magic. When a witchy gossip columnist dies, the peaceful convention turns riotous. To find the killer, Roman and Dylan must navigate a maze of lies, dark magic, and old rivalries.</p> <p>Queen Witch: When the new witch queen is murdered, Dylan is chosen to take her place as interim queen! Shouldn't be a problem, right? But stricken with guilt after an unfortunate accident, Dylan's been neglecting her studies. Now she must help find a murderer before someone else dies. If she and Roman cannot deduce the culprit, Dylan may be forced to give up her powers in the worst possible way—by dying herself.</p>"; 
